      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The trigger allows association when C2 JU is handling any track/point pair, but precondition claim 0 only establishes a Subsurface/ASW point-to-track pair and additionally requires refined point information. It does not independently cover the generic track/point-to-track/point association path, and it makes refined-information availability mandatory for the generic path even though the trigger presents that as a separate alternative."
      ]
